      "blocked": "The frame and branch registries were built by out-of-band `add-frame` / `add-branch` calls that no tracked file records. A-facts.json carries no `frames` and no `branches` key, yet its facts cite 4 frames (ground, hale, junia, pike) and 4 non-main branches (burn, confront, quiet, reveal), so the first fact fails with `frame 'ground' not present`. Reconstructing the registrations would be AUTHORING a step, not replaying one — the descriptions are lost — so this replay stays blocked until the registrations are recorded, and is never repaired by editing the manifests.",
